{"list_scraping_time": "1640924572", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=sapi&updated-max=2012-04-11T15:31:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=17&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2012/04/nasi-tomato-kukus-sajian-hari-minggu.html", "list_item_title": "Nasi Tomato Kukus, Sajian Hari Minggu", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "4/08/2012", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n12\n                              Comments\n                           \n", "list_item_category": "\nAyam\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Ayam?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640924573", "page_title": "Nasi Tomato Kukus, Sajian Hari Minggu", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "4/08/2012", "page_item_category": ["Ayam", "Daging", "Lauk Pauk", "Masakan Tradisional", "Nasi"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Ayam?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Daging?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Lauk%20Pauk?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Masakan%20Tradisional?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Nasi?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Sebenarnya dah lama saya ingin memasak Nasi Tomato sendiri. Biasanya Nana yang menyediakan Nasi Tomato dan saya pula menyediakan lauk pauk. Oleh kerana petang nanti saya akan berkumpul dan bersantai dengan kawan kawan Kolej Ketiga di rumah Dato' Salehuddin, jadi saya perlu menyediakan hidangan untuk anak anak di rumah.\u00a0", "Maklum mereka sekarang bukan mahu mengikut kita ke mana mana, apalagi ke rumah kawan kawan. Kalau ke shopping mall, mahulah mereka mengikut. Perjumpaan sepatutnya semalam tapi terpaksa ditunda atas sebab sebab teknikal, kata my hubby.\u00a0", "Sedang saya memasak, hubby menjenguk ke dapur dan memberitahu ingin menjemput Encik Fuzi dan Peggy, kawan sepejabat untuk datang makan tengahari bersama. Hmm nasib baik masa tu saya belum lagi menjerang nasi, sempat lah lagi menambah. Tapi seperti biasalah, periuk nasi kami ni kecil.\u00a0", "Jadi bila memasak dalam kuantiti yang banyak, air macam tak rata dan nasi tak masak sempurna. Panik juga sekejap. Nasib baik teringatkan periuk pengukus yang dibeli baru baru ini. Apa lagi, terus memindahkan nasi dari rice cooker ke dalam pengukus. Jadinya Nasi Tomato Kukus pulak, boleh tak gitu? Apa apa jer lah, yang penting nasi masak.\u00a0\u00a0", "Untuk Nasi Tomato hari ini, saya gandingkan dengan\u00a0", ",\u00a0", "\u00a0dan Acar Timun. Klik di link untuk melihat resepinya. Tak perlu nak search, lain kali senang nak buat rujukan. Nak citer sat, hari ini saya termalu sebab sebagai tuan rumah, saya makan menambah nambah kerana sedap nyer nasi tomato dengan lauk pauk yang disediakan. Hahaha\u00a0 masuk bakul angkat sendiri jap...", "Jom layan resepi dulu....", "NASI TOMATO KUKUS", "sumber: ", "\u00a0", "Oleh: ", "Bahan-Bahan:\u00a0", "5 cawan beras Basmathi - cuci dan toskan\u00a0", "1/2 cawan susu cair\u00a0", "4 biji tomato - cincang\u00a0", "1/2 cawan sos tomato\u00a0", "2 s/b majerin/minyak sapi\u00a0", "5 s/b minyak\u00a0", "Garam secukup rasa\u00a0", "Air (ikut sukatan beras dalam 5 cawan)\u00a0", "Daun pandan disimpul atau daun sup cincang\u00a0", "Bahan tumis\u00a0", "3 ulas bawang putih - hiris\u00a0", "5 ulas bawang merah - hiris\u00a0", "1 inci halia - hiris\u00a0", "3 biji Buah pelaga\u00a0", "3 biji Bunga cengkih\u00a0", "1 inci Kulit kayu manis\u00a0", "2 kuntum Bunga lawang\u00a0", "Cara cara:\u00a0", "Tumis bawang merah, putih, halia dan rempah dengan minyak dan minyak sapi hingga kuning dan naik bau.\u00a0", "Masukkan susu cair, tomato cincang, tomato sos, garam dan gaul rata. Tambah air, daun pandan dan\u00a0 masak sehingga air mendidih.\u00a0 ", "Masukkan beras. Alihkan ke dalam rice cooker dan masaklah seperti biasa.", "Apabila nasi telah kering, kacau rata perlahan lahan supaya nasi tidak patah dan hancur.\u00a0", "Boleh dihidangkan bersama lauk Beriani Kambing, Ayam Masak Merah dan Dalca atau Acar Timun..."], "page_description_image_url": ["https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-tS69SCvwanM/T4Iv_xyMWdI/AAAAAAAAJe4/80n5FDPt1T0/s640/IMG_0409.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-fk58CiY4Yb8/T4Iww1lKNLI/AAAAAAAAJfo/4O-ynIWq7FA/s640/IMG_0404.jpg", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-tS69SCvwanM/T4Iv_xyMWdI/AAAAAAAAJe4/80n5FDPt1T0/s640/IMG_0409.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-uk8L9urI9O8/T4IvstfyNTI/AAAAAAAAJeI/WH8hWWH0E4s/s640/IMG_0369.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-oUWwCrAz85k/T4IvvMT-MfI/AAAAAAAAJeQ/4lth6j6MkG4/s640/IMG_0371.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-VxZblC5uIIE/T4IvxwkMbqI/AAAAAAAAJeY/iaoW0UR2QNU/s640/IMG_0374.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-runkAUZ9s5g/T4IvzUbzFMI/AAAAAAAAJeg/B4MXlfOtClc/s640/IMG_0377.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-zrUPdVqTy4Y/T4Iv1gVMr3I/AAAAAAAAJeo/kWtX7aNTwxY/s640/IMG_0382.jpg", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-dWLXj-OqIUk/T4IxhtN6F0I/AAAAAAAAJfw/-aZMjIZuF08/s640/IMG_0418.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-OKhs9NpmkV4/T4IwFAKolcI/AAAAAAAAJfI/6Ic7FQinoCs/s640/IMG_0416.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-7dVyylPI7DY/T4Ki_ebwPZI/AAAAAAAAJf4/OHxRrBKrZhw/s640/IMG_0413.jpg"], "page_ulasan_count": "12 ulasan", "page_comment": ["Assalammualaikum kak azie... Nak Tanya.. hidangan nie untuk berapa orang makan ?", "As salam. Kalau di rumah kami 10 orang pun boleh. ", "Haaa.. ni lagi satu fav dish saya.. dh penah buat tp biasa pair up dengan ayam.masak merah biasa je.. nnti nak try masak beriani kambing tu.. ", "salam puan azie...kalau buah tomato tu ganti dgn tomato puree, blh x? nt nak guna brapa byk? tq pn.azie", "Salam puan azie klau nak masak 3cawan beras bhan2 yg lain semua sama sukatan ke?", "As salam, Puan Azie. Ada beberapa menu sudah saya cuba. Kebanyakkan client dtg dr semenanjung dan nampak kepuasan dr wajah mereka. Keep it up. Adalaka saya tambah sikit ramuan mengikut cara org kat Sarawak, namun kesedapan yg asli sememangnya dr Kak Azie sendiri. Wassalam.", "Assalamualaikum pn. azie.. saya dah mencuba resepi pn.. masyaAllah.. seronok tengok baik anak2 mahupun yg dewasa makan bertambah.. mohon halal yea ilmu masakan.. moga pn sentiasa dilimpahi rezki.. syukran!! \u2764\ufe0f", "Dah try. Memang sedapp. Tq puan azie \ud83d\ude18", "Guna beras biase boleh x kak", "Boleh", "Assalamualaikum kak Azie.saya mohon guna pakai resepi ya..\ud83d\ude0a", "Assalamualaikum puan. Guna rempah apa utk tumis?"], "page_comment_time": ["03 Jun, 2014 17:28", "03 Jun, 2014 17:45", "11 Julai, 2014 19:52", "26 Jun, 2015 13:17", "09 Disember, 2016 08:52", "06 Februari, 2017 17:51", "28 April, 2017 20:00", "02 Jun, 2017 13:26", "26 Jun, 2018 11:36", "26 Jun, 2018 13:19", "18 Julai, 2020 07:30", "20 Julai, 2021 08:14"], "page_comment_user": ["Unknown", "Azie", "Nida", "Ain Naim", "Unknown", "Unknown", "ctnurhusna", "iza shaklee", "Unknown", "Azie", "Unknown", "Arifah Azrie"], "page_comment_user_url": ["https://www.blogger.com/profile/07374589640428155063", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/00520116732922694940", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/10103885666849058965", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/12846518504686465762", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/15253050088394376600", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/07560899035084794257", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/13839255428563618263", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/10885935376179919062", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/00119325245731532820", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/08960672036669715885", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/15273514287679054647"], "page_comment_user_image_url": ["//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//2.bp.blogspot.com/-M97-